alue=\"Oman Visa Change by Bus\">Oman Visa Change by Bus<\/option><option value=\"Armenia Visa Change\">Armenia Visa Change<\/option><option value=\"Inside the country (T&amp;Cs Apply)\">Inside the country (T&amp;Cs Apply)<\/option><\/select><\/span>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"col-md-12\" style=\"margin-top:5px;\">\n  <br>\n<input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-hidden\" value=\"\" type=\"hidden\" name=\"submitted-from\" \/>\n  <input class=\"wpcf7-form-control wpcf7-submit has-spinner\" id=\"cf7-submit-btn\" type=\"submit\" value=\"Apply Now!\" \/>\n<\/div><p style=\"display: none !important;\" class=\"akismet-fields-container\" data-prefix=\"_wpcf7_ak_\"><label>&#916;<textarea name=\"_wpcf7_ak_hp_textarea\" cols=\"45\" rows=\"8\" maxlength=\"100\"><\/textarea><\/label><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"ak_js_1\" name=\"_wpcf7_ak_js\" value=\"8\"\/><script type=\"text\/javascript\">\n\/* <![CDATA[ *\/\ndocument.getElementById( \"ak_js_1\" ).setAttribute( \"value\", ( new Date() ).getTime() );\n\/* ]]> *\/\n<\/script>\n<\/p><div class=\"wpcf7-response-output\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><\/div>\n<\/form>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-c1abc8a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default row-top\" data-eae-slider=\"62991\" data-id=\"c1abc8a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"has_eae_slider elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-e4ec087\" data-eae-slider=\"6209\" data-id=\"e4ec087\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7464d88 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7464d88\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>\u00a0<\/p><h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here\u2019s how to get started<\/span><\/h3><p><b>Step 1: Get support<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Contact Waytransit if you have any questions regarding the A-to-A process. Our dedicated agents will walk you through the entire process. Airport visa change is popular for being the fastest way to exit and reenter the UAE.<\/span><\/p><p><b>Step 2: Book your flight<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Book a flight out of the UAE to the nearest and most affordable destination &#8211; our agent will make sure no additional processes or transit visas are required.<\/span><\/p><p><b>Step 3: Exit &amp; apply for the new visa<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After booking your flight and exiting, your new visa will be applied for and already under process.\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><b>Step 4: Fly back &amp; enjoy your stay in UAE<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Upon your return to one of UAE\u2019s international airports, you will receive confirmation of your visa approval and be able to re enter and continue enjoying all that UAE has to offer.<\/span><\/p><p><b>Opt for an airport to airport visa change package today with Waytransit Travels & Tourism.<\/b><\/p><h6><a href=\"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/terms-and-conditions\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><i>*T&amp;Cs Apply<\/i><\/span><\/a><\/h6><h4><b>Inclusions:\u00a0<\/b><\/h4><ul><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Roundtrip flights<\/span><\/li><li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">UAE Visa + Insurance<\/span><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Airport-to-Airport Visa Change An Airport-to-Airport visa change is one of the fastest and most straightforward visa change\u00a0 processes for current UAE tourists. Upon flying to the nearest possible destination, you hop back on a return flight while your new visa is processed and approved. If you\u2019re lucky the entire process does not usually last for [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":3,"featured_media":0,"parent":1397,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-2159","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2159","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/3"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=2159"}],"version-history":[{"count":7,"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2159\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4764,"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/2159\/revisions\/4764"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/1397"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/gulfoasistravelsandtourism.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=2159"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}